<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{% if title %}{{ title }} — {% endif %}{{ site.title }}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ description or site.description }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/css/style.css' | url }}">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">本文へスキップ</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <p class="site-kicker">{{ site.gameTitle }}（{{ site.publisher }} / {{ site.gameRelease }}）</p>
    <h1 class="site-title"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">{{ site.title }}</a></h1>
    <p class="site-lead">各項目は出典リンクと確認ラベル付き。推測・転載はしていません。</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="主要ページ">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="{{ '/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>トップ</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ '/haigo/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/haigo/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>配合</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ '/stud/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/stud/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>種牡馬・繁殖牝馬</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ '/ikusei/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/ikusei/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>育成・選別</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ '/ranch/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/ranch/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>牧場施設</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ '/bc/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/bc/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>BC・対人戦</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ '/zen/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/zen/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>前作の情報</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ '/my-ranch/' | url }}" {% if page.url == "/my-ranch/" %}aria-current="page"{% endif %}>自分の牧場</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <main id="main" class="site-main">
    <article class="page">
      <header class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">{{ title }}</h1>
        {% if updated %}
        <p class="page-meta"><time datetime="{{ updated | string }}">最終更新: {{ updated | formatDateJa }}</time></p>
        {% endif %}
      </header>
      {{ content | safe }}
    </article>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <p>個人の攻略メモ。ゲームデータの正確性は各出典でご確認ください。</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
